## How it was tested

- Upstream `main` 731fd392a + this branch (clean merge; it also merges cleanly onto 829b9477d, which touches no shop toml): `freshCache` + `mergePluginGamevals`, `buildCache`, `spotlessCheck`, `assemble`, `test` (726 tests, 0 failures), `integration` (79 tests, 0 failures), and the server boots to "Server ready". `tools/scripts/fix_gameval_conflicts.py --check`: no conflicts.
- The packed cache: `ServerCacheManager.getInventory(4)` (`inv.generalshop2`) has size 40, stack Always, scope Shared and the 14 stock entries above, in that order, with those counts and restock cycles.
- A one-off scan of the 395 tomls in `.data/raw-cache/server/shops` and the 6 inventories in the content packs' `pack/configs` found no other inventory with stock keys on its table, no `size`, or a `size` below its stock count.
- Not checked in game: nothing on `main` opens this shop yet (#351 does). No test added (a data fix; AGENTS.md skips config-matches-wiki tests).

